# Wealth Partner App — Enterprise Companion (CO-WP-101A)

Status: **ENTERPRISE APPROVED** · Frozen · Product Owner accepted 2026-07-31  
**Supreme rule:** CO-WP-CONSTITUTION-001 (Enterprise Companion Application Principle) — NON-NEGOTIABLE.

## Identity

The **Wealth Partner App** is an **Enterprise Companion Application** for Catalyst One.

It is **not** a standalone CRM, **not** Catalyst Connect (naming), and **not** an employee portal.

**Catalyst One THINKS. The Wealth Partner App PRESENTS.**

## Architecture

```text
Catalyst One (Enterprise OS)
  → Partner-scoped Enterprise APIs (Zero-Trust)
  → Wealth Partner App (presentation · session · UX)
```

## Hard rules

1. Recover and reuse the existing Wealth Partner App foundation — do not greenfield a replacement.
2. Preserve Vercel project `wealth-partner-app` and mobile-first UX.
3. Consume **only** partner-scoped Enterprise APIs — never employee APIs (e.g. `/api/wealth-partner-registry/**`).
4. No second business database · no duplicated commission/ROI/FOIR/eligibility/workflow logic.
5. Every request: Authenticated Partner → Partner UUID → Enterprise Mapping → Authorised Resource → Response. Deny if ownership unproven.
6. Apply **CO-WP-CONSTITUTION-001** PR gate on every WP App change (reject duplicated logic, in-app calculations, recreated registries, or non-Enterprise data sources).
7. **Availability:** If Catalyst One is unreachable, the app may only support login / session attempt and an **enterprise services unavailable** state — no meaningful business work, no demo-as-truth.
8. Apply **CO-WP-103B UX Constitution** — Daily Business Companion, not CRM/MIS. Home is an experience. Pass the morning enjoyment test. Experience Engine projections only (never companion-local content SSOT).
9. Apply **CO-WP-DEVELOPMENT-MODE-003** — develop **complete modules** (Home · Business · Saarthi · Private · More), not isolated screens. Expanded module DoD (skeletons, a11y, error/unavailable). Product Workspace from Enterprise DTOs only. Product Owner: Review → Refinements → Certification → Freeze → Deploy. Deploy only after Product Owner approval. MODE-002 is superseded.
10. Apply **CO-WP-ARCHITECTURE-UPDATE-001** — roadmap only (**DO NOT IMPLEMENT**). Enterprise Experience Engine (EEE) lives in Catalyst One. **Business module ON HOLD** until PO designs EEE architecture and authorises next phase. Never hardcode product pages, entitlements, or tier logic in the companion.

## Ownership

| Concern | Owner |
|---------|--------|
| Registries, workflow, calculations, documents, activities, commissions, communication, invitation, rules, credit, lender policy, approvals, reporting, **Experience Engine content** | Catalyst One |
| UX, mobile, presentation, navigation, secure session, device notifications, camera, file upload UI, approved offline UI | Wealth Partner App |

